```mermaid
graph TD
    CLIENTS["Clients (React Frontend / External)"]
    ESP["ESP32-S3 Edge Node"]

    subgraph Backend_App["FastAPI Application Tier (Python)"]
        ROUTER["API Router & Endpoints<br/>(main.py / routes)"]
        WS_MGR["ConnectionManager<br/>(WebSocket Broadcast Pool)"]
        
        subgraph Core_Services["Core Processing Services"]
            MQTT_SVC["MQTT Service (paho-mqtt)<br/>(Async Subscriber & Parser)"]
            SENSOR_SVC["Sensor Service<br/>(Data Ingestion & Routing)"]
            DSP_SVC["DSP Engine (NumPy / SciPy)<br/>(FFT, Peak-to-Peak, RMS)"]
            FAULT_SVC["Fault Detection Engine<br/>(ISO 10816 Thresholds & Rules)"]
            TINYML_IF["TinyML Bridge (ITinyMLDetector)<br/>(Extensible Edge Inference Slot)"]
        end

        subgraph Data_Access["Data Access Layer (Repository Pattern)"]
            ORM["SQLAlchemy ORM Models<br/>(SensorReading, FaultEvent, Machine)"]
            INFLUX_CLIENT["InfluxDB Client 2.0<br/>(Time-Series Point Writer)"]
        end
    end

    subgraph Storage_Tier["Data Tier"]
        SQLITE["SQLite Database<br/>(Relational: Metadata & Events)"]
        INFLUX["InfluxDB Bucket<br/>(High-Resolution Time Series)"]
    end

    ESP -->|MQTT Pub: industrial/mems/data| MQTT_SVC
    CLIENTS -->|HTTP GET / POST| ROUTER
    CLIENTS <-->|WebSocket Stream /ws/sensors| WS_MGR
    
    MQTT_SVC -->|Raw Payload| SENSOR_SVC
    SENSOR_SVC --> DSP_SVC
    DSP_SVC --> FAULT_SVC
    FAULT_SVC -.-> TINYML_IF
    
    SENSOR_SVC -->|Push Telemetry| WS_MGR
    SENSOR_SVC --> ORM
    SENSOR_SVC --> INFLUX_CLIENT
    
    ORM --> SQLITE
    INFLUX_CLIENT --> INFLUX
    ROUTER --> ORM
    ROUTER --> INFLUX_CLIENT
```
